            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/576623?u=88392c52422628facfd7cf108241d2864680915d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Fix bad example in CSS <code class=\"notranslate\">sibling-count()</code> function.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #40755.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3325778526\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40755\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40755/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40755\">#40755</a></p>",
