        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/432915?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Follow-up to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3330512741\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40782\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40782/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40782\">#40782</a> and <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3333135567\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40789\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40789/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40789\">#40789</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Main point being that you <em>can't</em> use the <code class=\"notranslate\">signal</code> option to close an already-established connection, you can only use it to cancel a connection attempt before it has been established.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">cc <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/tomayac/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/tomayac\">@tomayac</a> .</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>updates the guide page at <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/WebSockets_API/Using_WebSocketStream\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/WebSockets_API/Using_WebSocketStream</a> to give correct info about usage of <code class=\"notranslate\">signal</code> and how to close a connection.</li>\n<li>adds some subheadings to the examples in <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/WebSocketStream/WebSocketStream#examples\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/WebSocketStream/WebSocketStream#examples</a>, to make the structure clearer, and provides a bit of context for the stuff about closing a connection.</li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40821",
            "title": "More fixes for socket stream close documentation",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-21T10:38:15.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-20T17:45:19.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "wbamberg",
                "url": "https://github.com/wbamberg"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43580235?u=cae42d5a371dd041072ce6d85a1808de05535be8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Using <code class=\"notranslate\">&amp;</code> inside <code class=\"notranslate\">@scope</code> changes according to spec updates (and relation to <code class=\"notranslate\">:scope</code>).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This makes <code class=\"notranslate\">&amp; &amp;</code> redundant as far as I can see. The explainer has good context and I hope I've conveyed that in these changes.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Explainer:</strong> <a href=\"https://css.oddbird.net/scope/parent-selector/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://css.oddbird.net/scope/parent-selector/</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Bugs</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1975531\" rel=\"nofollow\">Change <code class=\"notranslate\">&amp;</code> behaviour inside <code class=\"notranslate\">@scope</code> block as per spec resolution</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Parent issue <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3249101586\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40481\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40481/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40481\">#40481</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> relnote <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3337599065\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40809\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40809/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40809\">#40809</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40814",
            "title": "docs(Fx142): css ampersand in at-scope content and `:scope`",
