        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF142 adds support for the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/URLPattern\" rel=\"nofollow\">URL Pattern API</a> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1731418\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1731418</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The docs are a little out of date according to the spec (i.e. in <a href=\"https://github.com/whatwg/urlpattern/pull/198/files\">https://github.com/whatwg/urlpattern/pull/198/files</a>). This attempts to fix them.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #30024.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1976775237\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/30024\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/30024/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/30024\">#30024</a><br>\n<span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #9327.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1010255219\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/9327\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/9327/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/9327\">#9327</a><br>\n<span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #27864.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1797535931\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/27864\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/27864/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/27864\">#27864</a><br>\n<span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #17763.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1288212242\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/17763\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/17763/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/17763\">#17763</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3249068112\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40474\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40474/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40474\">#40474</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40674",
            "title": "URL Pattern API updates",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-19T07:23:36.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-08T07:03:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 139 adds support for the <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-borders-4/#corner-shaping\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">corner-shape</code></a> property, and its related shorthands and longhands. See <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5357329815699456\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5357329815699456</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>A <code class=\"notranslate\">corner-shape</code> reference page</li>\n<li>Reference pages for all of its many constituent properties and related shorthands.</li>\n<li>A <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;corner-shape-value&gt;</code> data type ref page.</li>\n<li>A <code class=\"notranslate\">superellipse()</code> function ref page.</li>\n<li>Mentions of the new data type and function in the appropriate places.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40663",
            "title": "Editorial review: Document CSS corner-shape",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-21T14:07:35.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-07T10:24:53.000Z",
