        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #31787.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2088864337\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/31787\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/31787/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/31787\">#31787</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #32524.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2164896107\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/32524\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/32524/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/32524\">#32524</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #32629.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2177229832\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/32629\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/32629/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/32629\">#32629</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #33026.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2235843763\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/33026\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/33026/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/33026\">#33026</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">There are a lot of undesirable things about the parameter descriptions; I'm rewriting them based on the specs.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40660",
            "title": "Rewrite parameter descriptions for WebGL texture functions",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-07T13:56:27.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-07T05:45:57.000Z",
            "author": {
